# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in for local development.
#
# The published Chargeworthy dark map style needs a Mapbox PUBLIC token (pk.).
# It is a client token, safe to expose in the browser bundle; keep it out of
# git and restrict it by URL in the Mapbox console. The value lives in
# design/MAPBOX.md. In production it is an HF Space Variable of the same name.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
